sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as React
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant S3 as Amazon S3
  participant L as Lambda
  U->>FE: choose file
  FE->>API: POST /api/documents (multipart, JWT)
  API->>API: validate name, size, type, magic bytes, SHA-256
  API->>DB: BEGIN, insert document + version 1, flush (unique index checked)
  alt name already active
    DB-->>API: unique violation
    API-->>FE: 409 NAME_EXISTS
  else free
    API->>S3: PutObject (metadata, tags, ChecksumSHA256)
    alt S3 fails
      S3-->>API: error
      API->>DB: ROLLBACK
      API-->>FE: 502 STORAGE_ERROR
    else S3 ok
      S3-->>API: VersionId
      API->>DB: set s3_version_id, insert processing_job PENDING, COMMIT
      API-->>FE: 201 document
      S3-)L: ObjectCreated:Put (async, at-least-once)
      L->>S3: GetObject (if size <= 5 MB)
      L->>API: POST /api/internal/processing-results
      API->>DB: job PENDING -> SUCCEEDED / FAILED / SKIPPED
    end
  end
